(2751208, 384014, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photography. Love this shot. Best I have seen so far and don''t expect any better either. Don''t be surprised if there are people who can see only the rope and bits that look like eyes.<br/> <br/>There is something I want to metion though. I would liked the rope going out of the frame. I think it''d make people wonder more about the situation and what and where it''s tied to. Add a bit of the unknown. <br/>The way it is now, it does look like the rope isn''t tied to anywhere.<br/> <br/>Anyway, that''s just a thought.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful photography. Love this shot. Best I have seen so far and don''t expect any better either. Don''t be surprised if there are people who can see only the rope and bits that look like eyes. There is something I want to metion though. I would liked the rope going out of the frame. I think it''d make people wonder more about the situation and what and where it''s tied to. Add a bit of the unknown. The way it is now, it does look like the rope isn''t tied to anywhere. Anyway, that''s just a thought. Well done.', '2006-08-23 04:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2751214, 383884, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Love the lines and shadows and the mono look to it. <br/>It looks a tad bit on the sharper side to me, especially around the rope ladder and the ship''s name.<br/> <br/>Good work.</td>', 'Cool shot. Love the lines and shadows and the mono look to it. It looks a tad bit on the sharper side to me, especially around the rope ladder and the ship''s name. Good work.', '2006-08-23 04:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
