(2752876, 382362, 54728, '<td valign="top">haha.  That''s kinda funny. The sepia tone works well here. The rope is nice.  Tells a story.</td>', 'haha.  That''s kinda funny. The sepia tone works well here. The rope is nice.  Tells a story.', '2006-08-23 14:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752878, 384192, 35947, '<td valign="top">I find the bright spot above the head REALLY distracting.  You have a nice composition here and a little more even lighting (dark face except for chin) would really make this a nice image.</td>', 'I find the bright spot above the head REALLY distracting.  You have a nice composition here and a little more even lighting (dark face except for chin) would really make this a nice image.', '2006-08-23 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752879, 383920, 54728, '<td valign="top">This is just too blurry.  The camera must have shook as you took it.</td>', 'This is just too blurry.  The camera must have shook as you took it.', '2006-08-23 14:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752880, 383249, 54728, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Great capture.</td>', 'Cool.  Great capture.', '2006-08-23 14:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752881, 384020, 60868, '<td valign="top">No title?</td>', 'No title?', '2006-08-23 14:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752884, 381561, 58452, '<td valign="top">Wish the rope dropping down could go, and a little bright on the knot.  I like the contrast of the rough rope and smooth water.  Nice.</td>', 'Wish the rope dropping down could go, and a little bright on the knot.  I like the contrast of the rough rope and smooth water.  Nice.', '2006-08-23 14:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752887, 382143, 54728, '<td valign="top">Okay?  I don''t really get it.  I''m not sure the image works either.  Closer up would have been more interesting.  Don''t be afraid to get down at the level of the object you''re photographing.</td>', 'Okay?  I don''t really get it.  I''m not sure the image works either.  Closer up would have been more interesting.  Don''t be afraid to get down at the level of the object you''re photographing.', '2006-08-23 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752888, 383875, 54728, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious tone.  Makes me think of the phantom of the opera. Nice clear picture.</td>', 'Very mysterious tone.  Makes me think of the phantom of the opera. Nice clear picture.', '2006-08-23 14:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752889, 381459, 54728, '<td valign="top">Good job.</td>', 'Good job.', '2006-08-23 14:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752890, 383696, 54728, '<td valign="top">Clear close-up!</td>', 'Clear close-up!', '2006-08-23 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752891, 383558, 60997, '<td valign="top">I love the breadth of the exposure, it has the quality of a slow tech pan film I love.  I am especially partial to the contrast in texture; organically weathered wood along side the smoothness of the rope.  I am not as sold with the composition of the overall image.  The angled piece of rope in the forefront is nice as is the tied in the rear.  The even wrapped pieces in focus...how would it look slanted on an angle while keeping the focus as it is?  Is "used" a take on the weathered wood and pieces of rope?</td>', 'I love the breadth of the exposure, it has the quality of a slow tech pan film I love.  I am especially partial to the contrast in texture; organically weathered wood along side the smoothness of the rope.  I am not as sold with the composition of the overall image.  The angled piece of rope in the forefront is nice as is the tied in the rear.  The even wrapped pieces in focus...how would it look slanted on an angle while keeping the focus as it is?  Is "used" a take on the weathered wood and pieces of rope?', '2006-08-23 14:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752893, 383905, 58452, '<td valign="top">Do vikings come with this??  ;)<br/>Nice.</td>', 'Do vikings come with this??  ;)Nice.', '2006-08-23 14:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752894, 383626, 54728, '<td valign="top">Meh.  The feet are nice and the rain on pavement.  But the rope is blurry and that spoils it.</td>', 'Meh.  The feet are nice and the rain on pavement.  But the rope is blurry and that spoils it.', '2006-08-23 14:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752895, 383695, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow that red is bright.</td>', 'Wow that red is bright.', '2006-08-23 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752899, 381561, 60868, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting</td>', 'I like the lighting', '2006-08-23 14:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752900, 384082, 54728, '<td valign="top">Haha.  This is the most random submission yet.  Very curious photograph.  Technically, it could be clearer.  Rope is a bit fuzzy.</td>', 'Haha.  This is the most random submission yet.  Very curious photograph.  Technically, it could be clearer.  Rope is a bit fuzzy.', '2006-08-23 14:43:42.000000', NULL, 1);
