(2753278, 383679, 32345, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t that be cooked before? ;) <br/> <br/>Very good picture, I love it. Good job.</td>', 'Shouldn''t that be cooked before? ;)  Very good picture, I love it. Good job.', '2006-08-23 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2753287, 382578, 57661, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think the focus shouldn''t be soft, and the background darker. This photo gives me some ideas.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think the focus shouldn''t be soft, and the background darker. This photo gives me some ideas.', '2006-08-23 16:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2753303, 384115, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF to make the background look like a painting.  You''ve kept the rope as the primary subject, which is good considering the challenge theme.  My top pick...hope it does well for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF to make the background look like a painting.  You''ve kept the rope as the primary subject, which is good considering the challenge theme.  My top pick...hope it does well for you.  Good luck.', '2006-08-23 16:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2753308, 382916, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the image, however, I''m torn because the rope seems secondary in this image and rope is supposed to be the primary subject for the challenge.  Lovely cat!  ;^)</td>', 'I like the image, however, I''m torn because the rope seems secondary in this image and rope is supposed to be the primary subject for the challenge.  Lovely cat!  ;^)', '2006-08-23 16:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2753313, 383978, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice feel to this image.  The POV works well.  The lighting is just right and the image is well focused and sharp.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice feel to this image.  The POV works well.  The lighting is just right and the image is well focused and sharp.  Nicely done!', '2006-08-23 16:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2753317, 384014, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hope kitty rec''d a nice treat after this.  ;^)  I like the position you had when taking this shot with the camera being level with the rope on the floor.  The color contrast (rope vs cat) works quite well here.  You''ll probaly here some remarks about the cat looking the wrong way (out of the frame), but I think it adds a little bit of mystery to the shot.<br/> <br/>Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Hope kitty rec''d a nice treat after this.  ;^)  I like the position you had when taking this shot with the camera being level with the rope on the floor.  The color contrast (rope vs cat) works quite well here.  You''ll probaly here some remarks about the cat looking the wrong way (out of the frame), but I think it adds a little bit of mystery to the shot. Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-23 16:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2753320, 383918, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice lines in this well composed image.  Good use of light and texture as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice lines in this well composed image.  Good use of light and texture as well.  Well done!', '2006-08-23 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
