(2753324, 383246, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like shallow DOF shots like this.  You''ve put the focus where it counts and it''s nice and sharp.  The ground level view is what puts it all together from the viewing perspective.  Adds interest and a unique POV.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like shallow DOF shots like this.  You''ve put the focus where it counts and it''s nice and sharp.  The ground level view is what puts it all together from the viewing perspective.  Adds interest and a unique POV.  Nicely done!', '2006-08-23 16:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
