(2753676, 383965, 61818, '<td valign="top">Probably would have worked better in black and white, but would have worked better either way if not shot in such intense sunlight.  Some nice shapes in the rope, nice textures on that piece of wood.  The lighting sort of washes everything out though.  Composition is a little on theboring side, might have been nice to skip the grass and just really get in on that rope and/or the rope and board behind it.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Probably would have worked better in black and white, but would have worked better either way if not shot in such intense sunlight.  Some nice shapes in the rope, nice textures on that piece of wood.  The lighting sort of washes everything out though.  Composition is a little on theboring side, might have been nice to skip the grass and just really get in on that rope and/or the rope and board behind it.  Nice shot.', '2006-08-23 17:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
