(2754265, 383922, 19919, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the size has been mentioned.  I think a little more depth of field to see the whole rope would have helped.  I do like the color shift/lighting of the shot.</td>', 'I''m sure the size has been mentioned.  I think a little more depth of field to see the whole rope would have helped.  I do like the color shift/lighting of the shot.', '2006-08-23 20:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754271, 383920, 19919, '<td valign="top">You should utilize the full size available.  A slower shutter speed on a tripod would have left your rope focused with no motion blur, but would have put your water soft.  Good concept!</td>', 'You should utilize the full size available.  A slower shutter speed on a tripod would have left your rope focused with no motion blur, but would have put your water soft.  Good concept!', '2006-08-23 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754278, 383562, 19919, '<td valign="top">In some cases size is important.  There is a tutorial under the learn tab up top. Good focus from what I can see.</td>', 'In some cases size is important.  There is a tutorial under the learn tab up top. Good focus from what I can see.', '2006-08-23 20:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754284, 383719, 19919, '<td valign="top">Unsure of what it is, but having it full size would have helped.  It appears it''s a little overexposed/blown out.</td>', 'Unsure of what it is, but having it full size would have helped.  It appears it''s a little overexposed/blown out.', '2006-08-23 20:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754327, 382119, 61818, '<td valign="top">Too close to the background so all the wrinkles in the fabric show.  Time not spent pulling the background fabric taut to remove the large fold on the right.  White as a background for this was a poor choice.  Top of head sticking up at the bottom of the photo doesn''t work.  Composition could have better played up the triangular shape made of arms and robe but here the arms are sort of haphazardly arranged and the shot is off balance.  Finally, looks like this was shot with a flash or some really harsh straight-on light making for some nasty shadows.</td>', 'Too close to the background so all the wrinkles in the fabric show.  Time not spent pulling the background fabric taut to remove the large fold on the right.  White as a background for this was a poor choice.  Top of head sticking up at the bottom of the photo doesn''t work.  Composition could have better played up the triangular shape made of arms and robe but here the arms are sort of haphazardly arranged and the shot is off balance.  Finally, looks like this was shot with a flash or some really harsh straight-on light making for some nasty shadows.', '2006-08-23 20:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754332, 383439, 61818, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot.  I think the prop snake looks way too much like a prop snake, and a dime store prop at that.  Might have used a lense/aperture that would have maintained sharp focus on the rope while easing up a tad on the snake so it doesn''t come across looking as fake.  Like the background and the lighting overall.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot.  I think the prop snake looks way too much like a prop snake, and a dime store prop at that.  Might have used a lense/aperture that would have maintained sharp focus on the rope while easing up a tad on the snake so it doesn''t come across looking as fake.  Like the background and the lighting overall.', '2006-08-23 20:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754346, 383563, 60120, '<td valign="top">nice photo but does not meet what I think defines rope according to DP description...</td>', 'nice photo but does not meet what I think defines rope according to DP description...', '2006-08-23 20:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
