(2754399, 384165, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very poor choice of background for this shot.  It is extremely difficult to see your subject clearly, and that doesn''t bode well for the score.</td>', 'Very poor choice of background for this shot.  It is extremely difficult to see your subject clearly, and that doesn''t bode well for the score.', '2006-08-23 21:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754401, 383505, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good idea for this challenge, your setup is great. Technically, I can''t find anything wrong with this picture but just to be picky, I think that if we could see Professor Plum a bit better it would have been a perfect picture. Great job.</td>', 'Very good idea for this challenge, your setup is great. Technically, I can''t find anything wrong with this picture but just to be picky, I think that if we could see Professor Plum a bit better it would have been a perfect picture. Great job.', '2006-08-23 21:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754402, 384001, 32345, '<td valign="top">Different and funny, nicely done. Good job.</td>', 'Different and funny, nicely done. Good job.', '2006-08-23 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754406, 382362, 60120, '<td valign="top">wire in a rope....like it...I did one similar did not have a good piper though...ha..</td>', 'wire in a rope....like it...I did one similar did not have a good piper though...ha..', '2006-08-23 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754411, 384083, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the different textures. Angle and sepia tone adds interest!</td>', 'Nice job with the different textures. Angle and sepia tone adds interest!', '2006-08-23 21:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754417, 382187, 61818, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea gone bad.  Then again it has 3 decent looking girls in it so you will probably get a decent score for the effort.  To my eye, you''ve covered up the best parts of the girls with the rope and, by doing so, have pretty much negated their purpose for even being in this shot.  One girl carrying a rope lets me draw some conclusions, two playing tug of where could be interesting.  Three girls tangled up in a big rope, and apparently not concerned about it, says little to me at all.  I''m just not getting what it is you are trying to say here.  That said, I read the title after I look at the photo.  The titles/captions are meaningless, I want the photo to talk to me.<br/> <br/>Anyway, nice colors and the exposure looks good for such a bright day.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea gone bad.  Then again it has 3 decent looking girls in it so you will probably get a decent score for the effort.  To my eye, you''ve covered up the best parts of the girls with the rope and, by doing so, have pretty much negated their purpose for even being in this shot.  One girl carrying a rope lets me draw some conclusions, two playing tug of where could be interesting.  Three girls tangled up in a big rope, and apparently not concerned about it, says little to me at all.  I''m just not getting what it is you are trying to say here.  That said, I read the title after I look at the photo.  The titles/captions are meaningless, I want the photo to talk to me. Anyway, nice colors and the exposure looks good for such a bright day.', '2006-08-23 21:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754421, 384100, 61818, '<td valign="top">Border is obnoxiously large and there is something sticking out of the left edge of the photo which likely should have been cropped out.  I like the photo itself, nice shot.</td>', 'Border is obnoxiously large and there is something sticking out of the left edge of the photo which likely should have been cropped out.  I like the photo itself, nice shot.', '2006-08-23 21:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
