(2754428, 382862, 61818, '<td valign="top">Either too dark or not enough contrast, depending on how you look at it.  I like BW shots, especially high contrast with really dark areas like this, but it tends to work better when there is some highlights to balance it against.  here there is black, almost black, and gray.  Other than that, decent shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Either too dark or not enough contrast, depending on how you look at it.  I like BW shots, especially high contrast with really dark areas like this, but it tends to work better when there is some highlights to balance it against.  here there is black, almost black, and gray.  Other than that, decent shot.  Nice work.', '2006-08-23 21:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
