(2754463, 382743, 61818, '<td valign="top">Make it black and white and actually show the boobs and you''d have art.  As it is, you''ve got amateur bondage softporn.  Lighting is very harsh, composition is not pleasing to the eye.  Wrinkled bed spread or whatever it is beneath her gives the impression the shot was just taken off the cuff with little concern for quality.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'Make it black and white and actually show the boobs and you''d have art.  As it is, you''ve got amateur bondage softporn.  Lighting is very harsh, composition is not pleasing to the eye.  Wrinkled bed spread or whatever it is beneath her gives the impression the shot was just taken off the cuff with little concern for quality.  Better luck next time.', '2006-08-23 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
