(2754828, 383862, 61818, '<td valign="top">Love it, hope it does well.  Only thing I don''t like is the crop point on the right (in the frame) arm.  It looks like someone else is reaching down and grabbing the rope.  Other than that, cool lighting, great expression, interesting composition that leads the eye around.  Really good job. 9.</td>', 'Love it, hope it does well.  Only thing I don''t like is the crop point on the right (in the frame) arm.  It looks like someone else is reaching down and grabbing the rope.  Other than that, cool lighting, great expression, interesting composition that leads the eye around.  Really good job. 9.', '2006-08-23 22:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754832, 384065, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  I like everything about it but would offer two points to consider.  First, tip it slightly to the left so the strands are more horizontal (yeah I know they are wrapping around something, but still the left side looks off kilter), and second I would love to see it BW but without the greenish hue.  More yellow perhaps.  Anyways, really nice shot and good luck. 8.</td>', 'This is really nice.  I like everything about it but would offer two points to consider.  First, tip it slightly to the left so the strands are more horizontal (yeah I know they are wrapping around something, but still the left side looks off kilter), and second I would love to see it BW but without the greenish hue.  More yellow perhaps.  Anyways, really nice shot and good luck. 8.', '2006-08-23 22:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754835, 383624, 31307, '<td valign="top">What ship is this?</td>', 'What ship is this?', '2006-08-23 22:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754837, 383311, 61818, '<td valign="top">Love the photo.  You''ve done a great job of using BW to bring out the interesting texture in the rope.  Nice balance of blacks and midtones while still maintaining a lot of detail.  Only thing I don''t particularly like, just because it doesn''t really do anything for the shot, is the DOF.  The bottom few strands are out of focus and it is more distracting than anything as it doesn''t really lead your focus to anywhere - everything in the shot is the same.  Otherwise, great job.  Hope you do well. 8.</td>', 'Love the photo.  You''ve done a great job of using BW to bring out the interesting texture in the rope.  Nice balance of blacks and midtones while still maintaining a lot of detail.  Only thing I don''t particularly like, just because it doesn''t really do anything for the shot, is the DOF.  The bottom few strands are out of focus and it is more distracting than anything as it doesn''t really lead your focus to anywhere - everything in the shot is the same.  Otherwise, great job.  Hope you do well. 8.', '2006-08-23 22:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754846, 384040, 61818, '<td valign="top">Great tones, great contrast.  I love the symmetry of the composition which at the same time avoids coming across as lifeless.  The shot has a feeling of motion to me, or tension.  One thing that distracts me here is the gap about 1/3rd from the left on the bottom where you are looking through to - what.  Something that is not rope like everything else in the shot.  Also the leftmost strands stand out as very dark and sort of throw off the otherwise beautiful repetition of tones in the frame.  Not sure how much control you had over the setup of this or if it was ''found''.  Anyway, really nice work, I hope it scores highly. 8.</td>', 'Great tones, great contrast.  I love the symmetry of the composition which at the same time avoids coming across as lifeless.  The shot has a feeling of motion to me, or tension.  One thing that distracts me here is the gap about 1/3rd from the left on the bottom where you are looking through to - what.  Something that is not rope like everything else in the shot.  Also the leftmost strands stand out as very dark and sort of throw off the otherwise beautiful repetition of tones in the frame.  Not sure how much control you had over the setup of this or if it was ''found''.  Anyway, really nice work, I hope it scores highly. 8.', '2006-08-23 22:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754847, 382608, 61818, '<td valign="top">So many grubby hands in DPC challenges.  Like the photo.  Wash the hands.</td>', 'So many grubby hands in DPC challenges.  Like the photo.  Wash the hands.', '2006-08-23 22:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754848, 383875, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot and I''ll be interested to see how it fares once voting ends.  My first reaction was ''where was this for Black and White in Color''.  Very cool lighting and dark feeling to the shot.  The one thing I don''t care for here is the vertical rope leaning to the left.  It throws the picture off balance and it creates a problem for the eye by making the horizontal metal shaft ''appear'' to be not quite horizontal.  Other than that, really nice shot.  Hope it does ok.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot and I''ll be interested to see how it fares once voting ends.  My first reaction was ''where was this for Black and White in Color''.  Very cool lighting and dark feeling to the shot.  The one thing I don''t care for here is the vertical rope leaning to the left.  It throws the picture off balance and it creates a problem for the eye by making the horizontal metal shaft ''appear'' to be not quite horizontal.  Other than that, really nice shot.  Hope it does ok.', '2006-08-23 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754849, 383696, 61818, '<td valign="top">Really like the DOF.  Wonderful textures that you''ve done a great job of capturing here without, thank god, getting USM happy.  Great composition, I love the balance of the shot.  Overall just a really nice photo.</td>', 'Really like the DOF.  Wonderful textures that you''ve done a great job of capturing here without, thank god, getting USM happy.  Great composition, I love the balance of the shot.  Overall just a really nice photo.', '2006-08-23 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754850, 383558, 61818, '<td valign="top">Love it, hope it scores well.  Love the textures in both the rope and the piece of wood.  The BW processing has really done a gret job of highlighting this.  I like the DOF choice here.  Only complaint is I don''t care for the composition.  This begs to be centered in the frame to add symmetry to the list of admirable qualities of this shot.  Very nice, hope you do well.</td>', 'Love it, hope it scores well.  Love the textures in both the rope and the piece of wood.  The BW processing has really done a gret job of highlighting this.  I like the DOF choice here.  Only complaint is I don''t care for the composition.  This begs to be centered in the frame to add symmetry to the list of admirable qualities of this shot.  Very nice, hope you do well.', '2006-08-23 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754851, 384053, 61818, '<td valign="top">So many dirty hands in this challenge.  Nice shot.</td>', 'So many dirty hands in this challenge.  Nice shot.', '2006-08-23 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754852, 383926, 61818, '<td valign="top">Even though the challenge is Rope, I think the hands should be in sharp focus as well to better complete the image here.  Lighting is nice, composition is nice.  Could live without the piece of rope trailing off to the left side.</td>', 'Even though the challenge is Rope, I think the hands should be in sharp focus as well to better complete the image here.  Lighting is nice, composition is nice.  Could live without the piece of rope trailing off to the left side.', '2006-08-23 22:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754856, 384000, 61818, '<td valign="top">I think the negative space works against you here as does the overabundance of middle gray tones.  Some highlights, even if just light gray, would add some much needed contrast and spark to this shot.  I also wouldn''t be afraid of centering the subject here as I think it would work well.  Nice work.</td>', 'I think the negative space works against you here as does the overabundance of middle gray tones.  Some highlights, even if just light gray, would add some much needed contrast and spark to this shot.  I also wouldn''t be afraid of centering the subject here as I think it would work well.  Nice work.', '2006-08-23 22:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754857, 381459, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice BW, good composition.</td>', 'Nice BW, good composition.', '2006-08-23 22:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754859, 384186, 31307, '<td valign="top">Very neat "sheet shot."  However, I feel like the focus should be the reverse of what it is.  The eye is drawn--quite forcefully--to the hitches around the sheet but it is out of the focal area.  The resulting bluriness pushes the eye away from the subject and back into the other three quarters of the image.  I think that if you had focused on the detail of the rope and left the rigging out of focus the image would be better.  Still, though, I think it an interesting shot.  Good job.  What ship is that, out of curiosity?  It''s not the USCGA Eagle is it?</td>', 'Very neat "sheet shot."  However, I feel like the focus should be the reverse of what it is.  The eye is drawn--quite forcefully--to the hitches around the sheet but it is out of the focal area.  The resulting bluriness pushes the eye away from the subject and back into the other three quarters of the image.  I think that if you had focused on the detail of the rope and left the rigging out of focus the image would be better.  Still, though, I think it an interesting shot.  Good job.  What ship is that, out of curiosity?  It''s not the USCGA Eagle is it?', '2006-08-23 22:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754860, 383722, 61818, '<td valign="top">I don''t care much for desat shots but I think it works well here.  Nice texture on the rope as well as the hand.  Good composition and I like how you''ve filled the frame completely.  Like the DOF you''ve chosen here as well.  I actually had this at a 6 and was just rolling back through dropping comments but I''m going to bump this up to 8.  I actually like it more each time I view it.  Really nice work, good luck.</td>', 'I don''t care much for desat shots but I think it works well here.  Nice texture on the rope as well as the hand.  Good composition and I like how you''ve filled the frame completely.  Like the DOF you''ve chosen here as well.  I actually had this at a 6 and was just rolling back through dropping comments but I''m going to bump this up to 8.  I actually like it more each time I view it.  Really nice work, good luck.', '2006-08-23 22:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754864, 382550, 61818, '<td valign="top">Decent composition, nice DOF that focuses your eye on the main strand there.  The thing that I don''t care much for in this shot is the metallic tone of the rope itself.  I''m not sure if that is from PP or just the nature of the material, but it tends to kill some of the contrast in the shot and give it a washed out look.  Otherwise, nice work.</td>', 'Decent composition, nice DOF that focuses your eye on the main strand there.  The thing that I don''t care much for in this shot is the metallic tone of the rope itself.  I''m not sure if that is from PP or just the nature of the material, but it tends to kill some of the contrast in the shot and give it a washed out look.  Otherwise, nice work.', '2006-08-23 22:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754868, 383813, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, nice earthy tones.  I think the shot could be better balanced by cropping (or arranging the rope) so that the large strand is a bit more to the right and possibly aligned horizontaly.  nice work.</td>', 'Nice texture, nice earthy tones.  I think the shot could be better balanced by cropping (or arranging the rope) so that the large strand is a bit more to the right and possibly aligned horizontaly.  nice work.', '2006-08-23 22:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754871, 383939, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like to see the point of the challenge as the subject of the entry, and obviously that''s not the case here.  Still, it''s a cool shot with nice exposure and good crisp detail all around.  For purposes of the challenge (getting a bit more attention to the rope), might have cropped in more on the guy and the two other pieces of rope next to him.  Still, a pretty neat photo.  Good job.</td>', 'I like to see the point of the challenge as the subject of the entry, and obviously that''s not the case here.  Still, it''s a cool shot with nice exposure and good crisp detail all around.  For purposes of the challenge (getting a bit more attention to the rope), might have cropped in more on the guy and the two other pieces of rope next to him.  Still, a pretty neat photo.  Good job.', '2006-08-23 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754872, 382187, 31307, '<td valign="top">Way to play the male voters in the crowd.  No serously.  I am betting this image will get a lot of hits.  <br/> <br/>" 10!  Oh, this was a <i>rope</i> challenge?"</td>', 'Way to play the male voters in the crowd.  No serously.  I am betting this image will get a lot of hits.   " 10!  Oh, this was a rope challenge?"', '2006-08-23 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754877, 383829, 61818, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting here and I think the braided hair sort of adds another dimension to the ''rope'' theme.  What really kills me about this photo is the centered model offers a chance at symmetry and balance which is very pleasing to the eye and would work well with the negative space and highlights on her back and hands, yet the wooden floor beneath her is noticeably off kilter as far as being horizontal.  It distracts my eye.  Also think she might have pulled her left shoulder back a bit so that the light fell evenly across her upper back.  Nice photo, good luck.</td>', 'Like the lighting here and I think the braided hair sort of adds another dimension to the ''rope'' theme.  What really kills me about this photo is the centered model offers a chance at symmetry and balance which is very pleasing to the eye and would work well with the negative space and highlights on her back and hands, yet the wooden floor beneath her is noticeably off kilter as far as being horizontal.  It distracts my eye.  Also think she might have pulled her left shoulder back a bit so that the light fell evenly across her upper back.  Nice photo, good luck.', '2006-08-23 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2754880, 384109, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very simplistic, well composed shot.  Only thing that is sort of odd is that there are no apparent shadows beneath the rope, yet there is a shadow beneath the rope where it crosses over the rope below it.  some magic of physics I guess, but it looks odd.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Very simplistic, well composed shot.  Only thing that is sort of odd is that there are no apparent shadows beneath the rope, yet there is a shadow beneath the rope where it crosses over the rope below it.  some magic of physics I guess, but it looks odd.  Nice shot.', '2006-08-23 23:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
