(2759311, 383562, 62006, '<td valign="top">Looks like a piece of string tied to a bedpost. Maybe a larger picture, cropped to the bedpost to see more detail in the rope/string.</td>', 'Looks like a piece of string tied to a bedpost. Maybe a larger picture, cropped to the bedpost to see more detail in the rope/string.', '2006-08-25 10:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759316, 383719, 62006, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh. I can''t realy tell whether this is a piece of jewelery and a fabric rope.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh. I can''t realy tell whether this is a piece of jewelery and a fabric rope.', '2006-08-25 10:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759318, 383997, 55005, '<td valign="top">I would have likes to see this a bit brighter.  The photo looks a bit grainy but I am not sure if it is my monitor of the photo itself.  I like the composition, but I find cropped building on the right a bit too distructing, I would have cropped it out.</td>', 'I would have likes to see this a bit brighter.  The photo looks a bit grainy but I am not sure if it is my monitor of the photo itself.  I like the composition, but I find cropped building on the right a bit too distructing, I would have cropped it out.', '2006-08-25 10:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759322, 383922, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I think this would have been so much better if it were larger. As it is, you have to look at it for a momnet ti see what it is.</td>', 'Nice concept. I think this would have been so much better if it were larger. As it is, you have to look at it for a momnet ti see what it is.', '2006-08-25 10:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759323, 383518, 55005, '<td valign="top">Oh, I really like the light.  I wonder if cropping it tighter from the right would enhance the composition a bit -- it feels a bit too centered.  But overall, I like this photo -- great job!</td>', 'Oh, I really like the light.  I wonder if cropping it tighter from the right would enhance the composition a bit -- it feels a bit too centered.  But overall, I like this photo -- great job!', '2006-08-25 10:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759327, 383920, 62006, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea and can see what you were going for but it is too out of focus for my taste.</td>', 'I liked the idea and can see what you were going for but it is too out of focus for my taste.', '2006-08-25 10:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759332, 383003, 62006, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and framing, but it looks like a piece of string. A little more emphasis on the rope/string may have made the difference.</td>', 'Like the colors and framing, but it looks like a piece of string. A little more emphasis on the rope/string may have made the difference.', '2006-08-25 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759333, 384169, 55005, '<td valign="top">I think what makes this photo interesting for me is not the rope itself but how the blue sections come together, creating additional diagonals.  Very nice!  I would have liked to see the foreground a bit more in focus but softness does not bother me. Great job!</td>', 'I think what makes this photo interesting for me is not the rope itself but how the blue sections come together, creating additional diagonals.  Very nice!  I would have liked to see the foreground a bit more in focus but softness does not bother me. Great job!', '2006-08-25 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759336, 382862, 62006, '<td valign="top">Good picture. Like the choice of B&amp;W</td>', 'Good picture. Like the choice of B&W', '2006-08-25 10:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759340, 383562, 55005, '<td valign="top">It does not seem like the rope here is the main subject.</td>', 'It does not seem like the rope here is the main subject.', '2006-08-25 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759342, 384057, 62006, '<td valign="top">Don''t really like these noose photos, but that''s a personal choice. Good color and focus and the title fits well.</td>', 'Don''t really like these noose photos, but that''s a personal choice. Good color and focus and the title fits well.', '2006-08-25 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759343, 382169, 62006, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea. Would like to see the rope a little clearer in this shot.</td>', 'Awesome idea. Would like to see the rope a little clearer in this shot.', '2006-08-25 10:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759344, 383862, 55005, '<td valign="top">Wow, this man has big teeth!  :) Just kidding..  I really like the light here, love the diagonals created by his hands and the rope.  The dualtone here works just so well... I really hope to see this one ribbon.  Great job!</td>', 'Wow, this man has big teeth!  :) Just kidding..  I really like the light here, love the diagonals created by his hands and the rope.  The dualtone here works just so well... I really hope to see this one ribbon.  Great job!', '2006-08-25 10:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759346, 384004, 48228, '<td valign="top">Now this is a clever idea, and also quite comicial.....</td>', 'Now this is a clever idea, and also quite comicial.....', '2006-08-25 10:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759355, 382704, 55005, '<td valign="top">The light here does not work for me, as well as the overall softness of the photo.  Whatever it is on the right hand side is plain distructing.  My eye wonders between the piece of rope on the right hand side and the bright white dots on the bottom.  I wonder if exposing off the knot would have helped.</td>', 'The light here does not work for me, as well as the overall softness of the photo.  Whatever it is on the right hand side is plain distructing.  My eye wonders between the piece of rope on the right hand side and the bright white dots on the bottom.  I wonder if exposing off the knot would have helped.', '2006-08-25 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759359, 383244, 55005, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness of the rope and the pole!  It gives the photo so much character!  I almost feel like that cropping out the boat would actually help this, as the eye would not wonder between the boat and the pole with the rope.  Just my 2 cents.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness of the rope and the pole!  It gives the photo so much character!  I almost feel like that cropping out the boat would actually help this, as the eye would not wonder between the boat and the pole with the rope.  Just my 2 cents.', '2006-08-25 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759362, 382550, 55005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and lines!</td>', 'Wonderful texture and lines!', '2006-08-25 10:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759366, 383784, 55005, '<td valign="top">The whites here seem a bit too bright for me. However, I like the idea and all the rust..</td>', 'The whites here seem a bit too bright for me. However, I like the idea and all the rust..', '2006-08-25 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759373, 383189, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge!  I really like the tension in this photo, very nice!  I hope to see this one ribbon!  Great job!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge!  I really like the tension in this photo, very nice!  I hope to see this one ribbon!  Great job!', '2006-08-25 10:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759380, 383438, 55005, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and diagonals but I really do not like this color.. I would have liked to see it in BW or sepia, maybe...</td>', 'I like the lines and diagonals but I really do not like this color.. I would have liked to see it in BW or sepia, maybe...', '2006-08-25 10:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759383, 383766, 55005, '<td valign="top">The rope looks very overexposed and lost most of the details..</td>', 'The rope looks very overexposed and lost most of the details..', '2006-08-25 10:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759386, 383821, 55005, '<td valign="top">I really like the light, color, and composition of this one.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like the light, color, and composition of this one.  Well done!', '2006-08-25 10:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759389, 383920, 55005, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see it much more in focus...</td>', 'I would have like to see it much more in focus...', '2006-08-25 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759426, 383564, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the color in this.  May have worked stronger on a plain black background...  Anyway, good color, well focused, and the lighting/exposure is right on.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the color in this.  May have worked stronger on a plain black background...  Anyway, good color, well focused, and the lighting/exposure is right on.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759427, 383558, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for B/W treatment and for a shallow DOF.  You even managed to keep it off-center, which is challenging for the subject you''ve selected.  ;^)</td>', 'Nice choice for B/W treatment and for a shallow DOF.  You even managed to keep it off-center, which is challenging for the subject you''ve selected.  ;^)', '2006-08-25 11:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759471, 383318, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this more if the rope in the foreground was in focus, but just my opinion</td>', 'I think I would have liked this more if the rope in the foreground was in focus, but just my opinion', '2006-08-25 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759473, 383671, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good job, I like the way the lines lead into the knot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good job, I like the way the lines lead into the knot.  Good luck.', '2006-08-25 11:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759475, 381814, 32378, '<td valign="top">Well done, I like the fact that you didn''t blow out the highlights too much on the chrome, perhaps left hand part could have been more in focus.</td>', 'Well done, I like the fact that you didn''t blow out the highlights too much on the chrome, perhaps left hand part could have been more in focus.', '2006-08-25 11:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759479, 383784, 32378, '<td valign="top">The bright ball really pulls the eye away from the rope, although you did a good job holding most of the detail in it.</td>', 'The bright ball really pulls the eye away from the rope, although you did a good job holding most of the detail in it.', '2006-08-25 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759480, 382975, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the out of focus climbing gear in the back ground, it really helps tell the story of this rope.  good luck.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the out of focus climbing gear in the back ground, it really helps tell the story of this rope.  good luck.', '2006-08-25 11:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759482, 383438, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I think it may have been even more effective if it were a little sharper and the light a little lower to give more contrast between the threads.</td>', 'I like it.  I think it may have been even more effective if it were a little sharper and the light a little lower to give more contrast between the threads.', '2006-08-25 11:51:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2759484, 383929, 32378, '<td valign="top">Creative use of lighting, however something just seems awkward to me about the expression on her face.</td>', 'Creative use of lighting, however something just seems awkward to me about the expression on her face.', '2006-08-25 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759488, 384169, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice colors although highlights are a little blown out.</td>', 'Nice colors although highlights are a little blown out.', '2006-08-25 11:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759494, 383811, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the color tone of this, highlights are a little blown out, and I think I may have cropped this so the end was at the bottom of the shot.</td>', 'I like the color tone of this, highlights are a little blown out, and I think I may have cropped this so the end was at the bottom of the shot.', '2006-08-25 11:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759495, 382975, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color, and I like the background.  While the background is blurred by DOF, it''s still identifiable and is applicable to the image theme (plus, it matches your title, or vice-versa).  Only negative I can see you getting on this is the image is pretty much split down the middle.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice color, and I like the background.  While the background is blurred by DOF, it''s still identifiable and is applicable to the image theme (plus, it matches your title, or vice-versa).  Only negative I can see you getting on this is the image is pretty much split down the middle.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 11:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759496, 381966, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, with good lines.  Color tone for this works well.  good luck</td>', 'Nice composition, with good lines.  Color tone for this works well.  good luck', '2006-08-25 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759500, 384186, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective and the image is interesting to look at.  Well done!</td>', 'Wonderful perspective and the image is interesting to look at.  Well done!', '2006-08-25 11:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759501, 384083, 32378, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion but the color tone on this just doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Just my opinion but the color tone on this just doesn''t do much for me.', '2006-08-25 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759506, 384040, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this overall.  Nice contrast and a well-balanced B/W treatment.  I would like to see this in some other orientation maybe.  How did it look rotated right or left?  If you could have composed the shot with diagonal lines instead?  Just some thoughts.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this overall.  Nice contrast and a well-balanced B/W treatment.  I would like to see this in some other orientation maybe.  How did it look rotated right or left?  If you could have composed the shot with diagonal lines instead?  Just some thoughts.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759519, 384003, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has some nice pleasing lines to it.  The diagonals of the boat help as does the subtle reflection in the water.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has some nice pleasing lines to it.  The diagonals of the boat help as does the subtle reflection in the water.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 12:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759531, 382751, 30049, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title to this image.  What''s the purpose of the rope in this image?  I know, these questions aren''t really related to the quality of the image, but do help with context.  As for the image, the angled placement of the subject helps - it''s still a bit centered.  Some shadows falling on the right end of the rope could be eliminated with a light reflector to fill.  I keep getting distracted by what appears to be some text under the paper on the left center side of the photo.  All of the above is JMO of course.  ;^)<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title to this image.  What''s the purpose of the rope in this image?  I know, these questions aren''t really related to the quality of the image, but do help with context.  As for the image, the angled placement of the subject helps - it''s still a bit centered.  Some shadows falling on the right end of the rope could be eliminated with a light reflector to fill.  I keep getting distracted by what appears to be some text under the paper on the left center side of the photo.  All of the above is JMO of course.  ;^) Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 12:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759535, 383857, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the lighting on this leaves the image a little flat and lifeless.  Also looks to be underexposed some.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m afraid the lighting on this leaves the image a little flat and lifeless.  Also looks to be underexposed some.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 12:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759539, 383694, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s ok.  Lighting is on the hot side.  This may have had more potential with early or late day sunlight instead?  Focus and sharpness look fine.  If you could remove that single strand of different rope from the composition I think it would help.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s ok.  Lighting is on the hot side.  This may have had more potential with early or late day sunlight instead?  Focus and sharpness look fine.  If you could remove that single strand of different rope from the composition I think it would help.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 12:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759544, 383626, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good idea - creative take on the challenge.  If this image wasn''t so underexposed it would have a good shot of rising to the top 30% or so in the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Good idea - creative take on the challenge.  If this image wasn''t so underexposed it would have a good shot of rising to the top 30% or so in the challenge.  Good luck.', '2006-08-25 12:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759612, 383406, 51538, '<td valign="top">Perhaps my favourite of this challenge.  Nice lighting on the ropes. 8.</td>', 'Perhaps my favourite of this challenge.  Nice lighting on the ropes. 8.', '2006-08-25 12:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759615, 381459, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good point of view there.  I like the old rope and wood.  Possibly a warmer, duto-tone might have worked better. 7.</td>', 'Good point of view there.  I like the old rope and wood.  Possibly a warmer, duto-tone might have worked better. 7.', '2006-08-25 12:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759616, 383350, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and colors..down sue that''s not yours..sorry...good composition. A little busy for my taste. Good luck to ya.</td>', 'Nice focus and colors..down sue that''s not yours..sorry...good composition. A little busy for my taste. Good luck to ya.', '2006-08-25 12:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759619, 383564, 40430, '<td valign="top">very vbrant and nice composition</td>', 'very vbrant and nice composition', '2006-08-25 12:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759621, 383567, 51538, '<td valign="top">For tying tippets on fly line, I believe is a common use.  Nice sequence there and the colours and white balance are pretty good. 7.</td>', 'For tying tippets on fly line, I believe is a common use.  Nice sequence there and the colours and white balance are pretty good. 7.', '2006-08-25 12:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759622, 382774, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice photo..not my thing...but good placement and focus.</td>', 'Nice photo..not my thing...but good placement and focus.', '2006-08-25 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759623, 384040, 51538, '<td valign="top">The strength of the rope comes over well in your photo.  Nice tones and lighting. 7.</td>', 'The strength of the rope comes over well in your photo.  Nice tones and lighting. 7.', '2006-08-25 12:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759625, 384150, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice emphasis on the rope. I like the lighting but the little white line on the right is a bit distracting</td>', 'Nice emphasis on the rope. I like the lighting but the little white line on the right is a bit distracting', '2006-08-25 12:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759626, 384050, 40430, '<td valign="top">like the title</td>', 'like the title', '2006-08-25 12:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759627, 382119, 62006, '<td valign="top">More lighting or emphasis on the rope to bring out the details would have been a little better.</td>', 'More lighting or emphasis on the rope to bring out the details would have been a little better.', '2006-08-25 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759632, 383762, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and placement. Maybe a landscape shot with the rope and cleet off center would be a little nicer.</td>', 'Nice shot and placement. Maybe a landscape shot with the rope and cleet off center would be a little nicer.', '2006-08-25 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759634, 383587, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but it doesn''t stand out for me. Maybe a closer shot on one of the knots, off centered would make this better for me. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice picture but it doesn''t stand out for me. Maybe a closer shot on one of the knots, off centered would make this better for me. Good luck.', '2006-08-25 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759638, 383922, 60744, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot...very original!  You might consider resizing a pic to 640 pixels on your longest edge so that you submit the biggest picture possible to let viewers really see the image!</td>', 'This is a cool shot...very original!  You might consider resizing a pic to 640 pixels on your longest edge so that you submit the biggest picture possible to let viewers really see the image!', '2006-08-25 13:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759641, 382916, 62006, '<td valign="top">More focus on the rope and less on the cat would have been a better shot for me, however, nice colors and placement of the rope in the frame. Excellent lighting.</td>', 'More focus on the rope and less on the cat would have been a better shot for me, however, nice colors and placement of the rope in the frame. Excellent lighting.', '2006-08-25 13:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759644, 383194, 62006, '<td valign="top">Picture does not work for me but has good colors and composition. Nice job.</td>', 'Picture does not work for me but has good colors and composition. Nice job.', '2006-08-25 13:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759648, 383563, 62006, '<td valign="top">Nice angle. Maybe the lighting could be a little different to bring out the rope more and a little more focus on the whole image.</td>', 'Nice angle. Maybe the lighting could be a little different to bring out the rope more and a little more focus on the whole image.', '2006-08-25 13:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759650, 383626, 62006, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea but if you had captured the rope to add more detail to the image, it would have been better for me.</td>', 'Wonderful idea but if you had captured the rope to add more detail to the image, it would have been better for me.', '2006-08-25 13:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759692, 382383, 47854, '<td valign="top">A perfect photoin all respect and for the title</td>', 'A perfect photoin all respect and for the title', '2006-08-25 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759700, 382920, 47854, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo with a story</td>', 'beautiful photo with a story', '2006-08-25 13:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759704, 382707, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked a little more depth of field especially in the lower left hand corner to help draw me up the rope.</td>', 'I think I would have liked a little more depth of field especially in the lower left hand corner to help draw me up the rope.', '2006-08-25 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759706, 384169, 47854, '<td valign="top">good colour and design</td>', 'good colour and design', '2006-08-25 13:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759707, 383366, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the colors on this.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the colors on this.', '2006-08-25 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759712, 383811, 47854, '<td valign="top">natural look and colour</td>', 'natural look and colour', '2006-08-25 13:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759713, 383694, 32378, '<td valign="top">This seems a little busy to me, not sure what to focus on and lighting was a tad harsh.</td>', 'This seems a little busy to me, not sure what to focus on and lighting was a tad harsh.', '2006-08-25 13:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759715, 382916, 32378, '<td valign="top">Hmmm nice picture of the cat, however I think for this challenge the subject really needed to be the rope.</td>', 'Hmmm nice picture of the cat, however I think for this challenge the subject really needed to be the rope.', '2006-08-25 13:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759723, 384029, 47854, '<td valign="top">good selection of colour combination</td>', 'good selection of colour combination', '2006-08-25 13:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759727, 383247, 32378, '<td valign="top">This seems a little to busy for my, I think there was a chance to put all the rope in some context with the building in the back ground but doesn''t really happen.</td>', 'This seems a little to busy for my, I think there was a chance to put all the rope in some context with the building in the back ground but doesn''t really happen.', '2006-08-25 13:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759730, 383080, 47854, '<td valign="top">perfect story for the title</td>', 'perfect story for the title', '2006-08-25 13:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759734, 384053, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the lighting.  good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the lighting.  good luck.', '2006-08-25 13:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759742, 383563, 32378, '<td valign="top">Trying to figure out what the rope is in this.  I don''t think it is the drum head and strings below it seem out of focus.</td>', 'Trying to figure out what the rope is in this.  I don''t think it is the drum head and strings below it seem out of focus.', '2006-08-25 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759761, 383762, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective on this, only thing that would have helped is if the boat were a little more out focus, imho.  Otherwise this tells the story very nicely.  good luck</td>', 'I like the perspective on this, only thing that would have helped is if the boat were a little more out focus, imho.  Otherwise this tells the story very nicely.  good luck', '2006-08-25 13:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759762, 382743, 32378, '<td valign="top">very creative. although you know some will not like it.</td>', 'very creative. although you know some will not like it.', '2006-08-25 13:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759767, 382875, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the caterpillar moth is nice and sharp and very colorful.  Composition is good and uses the theme of the rope well.</td>', 'Nice shot, the caterpillar moth is nice and sharp and very colorful.  Composition is good and uses the theme of the rope well.', '2006-08-25 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759775, 382119, 32378, '<td valign="top">Several things on this picture, first I would put the back drop farther away from the subject to let it be able to be out of focus, some lighting on the rope and hands would have helped to bring out some detail in the rope and I would have set this up or cropped it so none of the head was in the picture.</td>', 'Several things on this picture, first I would put the back drop farther away from the subject to let it be able to be out of focus, some lighting on the rope and hands would have helped to bring out some detail in the rope and I would have set this up or cropped it so none of the head was in the picture.', '2006-08-25 13:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
