(2760114, 383563, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why is this titled ''Diamond Strings''?  Considering that this is a ''Rope'' challenge that might have been a mistake...nonetheless, on the serious side - what''s the connection?  Is it the knots used or something?<br/> <br/>As for the image itself I like the way you''ve put it together.  The layout is divided in a ROT manner, the lighting is good with focus hitting the sweet spot of the rope/cord/string, and the DOF fadeout at the bottom works well.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why is this titled ''Diamond Strings''?  Considering that this is a ''Rope'' challenge that might have been a mistake...nonetheless, on the serious side - what''s the connection?  Is it the knots used or something? As for the image itself I like the way you''ve put it together.  The layout is divided in a ROT manner, the lighting is good with focus hitting the sweet spot of the rope/cord/string, and the DOF fadeout at the bottom works well. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2760123, 382704, 30049, '<td valign="top">I get the point but a couple of things are pulling this down IMO.  The rope you''ve focused on isn''t the swing part - should have tried to focus on the actual swing seat with all that rope hanging down (after all, your title does say Swing ;-)  While this is a fun idea, the subject is getting lost in the busy background (trees, sky).  You also seem to be blown out in the highlights.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I get the point but a couple of things are pulling this down IMO.  The rope you''ve focused on isn''t the swing part - should have tried to focus on the actual swing seat with all that rope hanging down (after all, your title does say Swing ;-)  While this is a fun idea, the subject is getting lost in the busy background (trees, sky).  You also seem to be blown out in the highlights.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 16:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2760130, 382297, 30049, '<td valign="top">What''s the ''Contradiction''?  Were they still hanging people in 1998?  It''s a clever image I presume, but without the connection between the noose and the human rights act the image loses some punch.  Exposure and technicals are fine for the most part and I like the way you''ve framed the text with the noose.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'What''s the ''Contradiction''?  Were they still hanging people in 1998?  It''s a clever image I presume, but without the connection between the noose and the human rights act the image loses some punch.  Exposure and technicals are fine for the most part and I like the way you''ve framed the text with the noose.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2760141, 384004, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is cute (I think) and well put together as far as image details/technicals go.  I''m not sure I like the message with a young girl being bound in rope, but that''s just me.  You''ll probably do well with this as the image does hold the viewers interest long enough to get a good look, and as stated before, the technicals are very good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is cute (I think) and well put together as far as image details/technicals go.  I''m not sure I like the message with a young girl being bound in rope, but that''s just me.  You''ll probably do well with this as the image does hold the viewers interest long enough to get a good look, and as stated before, the technicals are very good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-25 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
