(2760177, 382747, 52500, '<td valign="top">I bet that took some work to do!  Cool idea.  The color is really vibrant, which is nice, but the color itself (the orangish) doesn''t really work for me.  I bet this totally rocks in B/W.</td>', 'I bet that took some work to do!  Cool idea.  The color is really vibrant, which is nice, but the color itself (the orangish) doesn''t really work for me.  I bet this totally rocks in B/W.', '2006-08-25 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
