(2764338, 384014, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a good kitty to let you do this to him - excellent actor too!  I love the black on black and the lighting here.  Great composition.  Bumping you up to 9.</td>', 'What a good kitty to let you do this to him - excellent actor too!  I love the black on black and the lighting here.  Great composition.  Bumping you up to 9.', '2006-08-27 13:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
