(2764436, 384186, 43774, '<td valign="top">I would rather see the rope in the front in focus and the ship in the background out of focus. Your composition is excellent, I just don''t like the DOF.</td>', 'I would rather see the rope in the front in focus and the ship in the background out of focus. Your composition is excellent, I just don''t like the DOF.', '2006-08-27 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
