(2764890, 384050, 18073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot here.  I kind of like the texture of the rope and boat against the silky smooth water.  Composition is okay too, but I think it could do with a little more contrast.</td>', 'Interesting shot here.  I kind of like the texture of the rope and boat against the silky smooth water.  Composition is okay too, but I think it could do with a little more contrast.', '2006-08-27 19:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764895, 384193, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the composition is okay here, but its the colour that really grabs the attention.  My only real issue is that parts of the rope seem a little soft, but it could just be the texture of the rope.  All in all a nice image, good job and noce eye.</td>', 'Nice shot, the composition is okay here, but its the colour that really grabs the attention.  My only real issue is that parts of the rope seem a little soft, but it could just be the texture of the rope.  All in all a nice image, good job and noce eye.', '2006-08-27 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764897, 383917, 18073, '<td valign="top">nice textures here and okay composition.  I think the B&amp;W works very well too.  Nice shot</td>', 'nice textures here and okay composition.  I think the B&W works very well too.  Nice shot', '2006-08-27 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764900, 381983, 18073, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting shot, but personally I find the crossbar near the bottom of the shot quite distracting, perhaps a tighter crop, just including the net itself would have looked ''cleaner'', if you know what I mean.</td>', 'Quite an interesting shot, but personally I find the crossbar near the bottom of the shot quite distracting, perhaps a tighter crop, just including the net itself would have looked ''cleaner'', if you know what I mean.', '2006-08-27 19:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764905, 383920, 18073, '<td valign="top">Way way way too blurred and out of focus.  Also, the composition is not good, with the subject just being places in the center of the shot this way.  You really need to concentrate on your technique to eliminate camera shake as much as possible.</td>', 'Way way way too blurred and out of focus.  Also, the composition is not good, with the subject just being places in the center of the shot this way.  You really need to concentrate on your technique to eliminate camera shake as much as possible.', '2006-08-27 19:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764907, 383469, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great stuff!  I love the graphic quality to this shot and even though there is no real pattern to the rope you still seem to have got the composition right, it just seems kind of balanced.  Great colour too, good luck<br/> <br/>D</td>', 'Great stuff!  I love the graphic quality to this shot and even though there is no real pattern to the rope you still seem to have got the composition right, it just seems kind of balanced.  Great colour too, good luck D', '2006-08-27 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764910, 383813, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with some nice texture, but for me the colour seems a little flat.  I would suggest a little more contrast or even a moody mono shot.  A nice image all the same though, nice woork.</td>', 'Nice shot with some nice texture, but for me the colour seems a little flat.  I would suggest a little more contrast or even a moody mono shot.  A nice image all the same though, nice woork.', '2006-08-27 19:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2764914, 383862, 18073, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, love the lighting, composition and expression of the ''captive''.  I reckon this wil do well, and is easilly in my top 5 shots, great work!</td>', 'Awesome shot, love the lighting, composition and expression of the ''captive''.  I reckon this wil do well, and is easilly in my top 5 shots, great work!', '2006-08-27 19:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
