(2773568, 383875, 37719, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  Very well shot - nice crisp lines, detail is perfect, black and white was an excellent choice!  The lighting on this is very well done - just enough to present the subject.  This has a sort of ''nostalgic'' feel to it.  When I first viewed it I thought of old time radio shows where all the sound effects were produced on stage live with the performers - those big sheets of metal they would suspend so they could rattle them for thunnder and lightning sounds or even a vaudeville act of old theater.  Very well done Jimmy!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-30 16:19:52.</i></td>', 'Excellent composition!  Very well shot - nice crisp lines, detail is perfect, black and white was an excellent choice!  The lighting on this is very well done - just enough to present the subject.  This has a sort of ''nostalgic'' feel to it.  When I first viewed it I thought of old time radio shows where all the sound effects were produced on stage live with the performers - those big sheets of metal they would suspend so they could rattle them for thunnder and lightning sounds or even a vaudeville act of old theater.  Very well done Jimmy!', '2006-08-30 08:25:13.000000', '2006-08-30 17:19:52.000000', 0),
