(2778329, 382875, 1707, '<td valign="top">geesh! As a girly girl I would have most likely ran away screaming if I ever found such an ugly thing in my garden!  :) And you are making me rethink that perhaps I could try resisting such reaction.....<br/>Thanks for submitting.  I''ve never seen Saddleback Caterpillar Moth. It actually looks like a one of those figurine toys for boys.  You may want to submit this picture as "Stock Photography."  Could make a few dollars off of it.  Somebody out there might be looking for a really good photo of a  Saddleback Caterpillar Moth. Which this one is!  Congrats on its placement in this contest!</td>', 'geesh! As a girly girl I would have most likely ran away screaming if I ever found such an ugly thing in my garden!  :) And you are making me rethink that perhaps I could try resisting such reaction.....Thanks for submitting.  I''ve never seen Saddleback Caterpillar Moth. It actually looks like a one of those figurine toys for boys.  You may want to submit this picture as "Stock Photography."  Could make a few dollars off of it.  Somebody out there might be looking for a really good photo of a  Saddleback Caterpillar Moth. Which this one is!  Congrats on its placement in this contest!', '2006-08-31 10:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
